    "done_when": "per §25's relevance-trial node and §14's code run: before any remote call, create the ssh wrapper from the repository AGENTS.md section on fenced workers (mkdir -p /tmp/sshwrap, a script running /usr/bin/ssh -F $HOME/.ssh/config, export PATH=/tmp/sshwrap:$PATH) and confirm ssh -o BatchMode=yes jt-60sa hostname answers; record per prefix the CodeFile count by status and relevance_stage before the first pass; run, each as one blocking foreground call with a 9 minute timeout, first 'UV_PROJECT_ENVIRONMENT=/home/ITER/mcintos/Code/imas-codex/.venv PYTHONPATH=$PWD uv run --no-sync imas-codex discover code jt-60sa --path-prefix /analysis/src/SAeqread --path-prefix /analysis/src/client_eqdbms.EQ32.Rev1 --path-prefix /analysis/src/SAeqfame --path-prefix /analysis/src/getseldata_v4.2 --path-prefix /analysis/src/SAselene_v2.0_forPSRC --path-prefix /analysis/lib/eqdbms --path-prefix /analysis/lib/JT60SAEQDB --focus equilibrium --min-score 0 --time 8 --reset-to discovered' and then 'UV_PROJECT_ENVIRONMENT=/home/ITER/mcintos/Code/imas-codex/.venv PYTHONPATH=$PWD uv run --no-sync imas-codex discover code jt-60sa --path-prefix /analysis/src/SAeqread --path-prefix /analysis/src/client_eqdbms.EQ32.Rev1 --path-prefix /analysis/src/SAeqfame --path-prefix /analysis/src/getseldata_v4.2 --path-prefix /analysis/src/SAselene_v2.0_forPSRC --path-prefix /analysis/lib/eqdbms --path-prefix /analysis/lib/JT60SAEQDB --focus equilibrium --min-score 0 --time 8' until its log reports no pending work or six passes have run; afterwards record per prefix the counts by status and relevance_stage, the ingested files, the relevance and status of geteddb.c, outeddb.c, eddbaccess.h, fercor.f, eqjt60.f, inpgeo.c and mgset0.f, and whether any file under SAselene_v2.0_forPSRC/minpack was ingested; separately, score the 128-file labelled set in /home/ITER/mcintos/.cache/imas-codex-jev/sample.json against labels.json (in scope = L, P, G or I) by calling the deployed content-arm state builder and questions from imas_codex/discovery/code/scorer.py through acall_decisions on the discovery-relevance seat, and report its AUC and the precision and recall at 0.5; total the Jev and model spend from the run logs and the decisions costs; write the evidence fragment with one figure of content relevance by labelled class (data-ink style, SVG) and the measured numbers; no reset or run outside the seven prefixes, no facility-wide command, and the evidence names every count it reports with the query that produced it",
